{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "The Shopping Spree", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Looking Cool!", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 7, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe taste and style in music and fashion through a wider range of language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Making Comparisons", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "We use <span class=\"italic\">as</span> + adjective/adverb + <span class=\"italic\">as</span> to make comparisons when the things we are comparing are equal in some way:<br/><br/><span class=\"italic\">This leather jacket is <span class=\"strong\">as soft as</span> a sweater!</span><br/><br/>We use not <span class=\"italic\">as</span> ... <span class=\"italic\">as</span> to make comparisons between things which aren't equal:<br/><br/><span class=\"italic\">This leather jacket is<span class=\"strong\">n't as expensive as</span> that one.</span>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "I'm not <span class=\"strong\">as well-versed on names of musicals as</span> I should be though.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "That would give us a list of <span class=\"strong\">as many movies as</span> we could watch in an evening.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It wasn't nearly <span class=\"strong\">as good as</span> others we've been to.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Maybe this wasn't <span class=\"strong\">as interesting as</span> others because we're a bit jaded.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When you have been to <span class=\"strong\">as many good concerts as</span> we've been to, we shouldn't complain.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Responses with <span class=\"italic\">So</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Neither</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "We use <span class=\"italic\">so</span> and <span class=\"italic\">neither</span> for positive and negative agreement.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">So</span> is used to show agreement with positive statements. <br/>Sometimes we also use <span class=\"italic\">too</span> to express the same thing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/><br/><span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: <span class=\"italic\">I like this dress!</span></span><br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: <span class=\"italic\">So do I./I do too.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Neither</span> is used to show agreement with negative statements. <br/>Sometimes we also use <span class=\"italic\">either</span> to express the same thing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/><br/><span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>:<br/><span class=\"italic\"> I don't think this fits well.</span><br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Neither do I. </span>(neither is a negative word)<br/><span class=\"italic\">I don't either. </span>(either is used with the negative)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you use <span class=\"italic\">so</span> and <span class=\"italic\">neither</span>, the auxiliary needs to agree with the verb tense in the original statement.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "A more colloquial form of positive agreement is <span class=\"italic\">Me too</span>.<br/>A more colloquial form of negative agreement is <span class=\"italic\">Me neither</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Statement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Positive agreement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>I think this was a great idea!</p><p>I'm glad I could make it!</p><p>The food is as good as I get from the priciest places in town!</p><p>That is as far as it goes for now, I think.</p></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>So do we!</p><p>So are we! </p><p>I think so too.</p><p>Me too.</p></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Statement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Negative agreement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>Mine are never as tasty as yours.</p><p>I'm not so sure about that ...</p><p>I'm never going to be a great cook!</p></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>Neither are mine!</p><p>Neither am I. </p><p>I'm not either, Sal.</p></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "movie buff", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who knows a lot about movies", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He's a big movie buff; he watched movies all weekend.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you need to review.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Hollywood", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place in the U.S. that is famous for making films", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'd like to watch some old Hollywood musicals this weekend. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "slick", "type": "name"}, {"content": "well done; expertly done ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Music Man parody was almost as slick as past musical productions.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "shopathon", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a marathon shopping trip", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I don't think Peter is up to one of our shopathons.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "vintage-look", "type": "name"}, {"content": "looks like it made in the past", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's a vintage-look top. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "rap ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a type of music", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm not fond of rap but I like rock 'n' roll.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "marked down", "type": "name"}, {"content": "on sale", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The clothing is marked down.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob11aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to step up your game", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to compete at a higher level", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have to step up my game at work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob11aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Identify what types of movies you like.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say what types are the best or the worst for you.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a review of 125 words on a movie you have recently seen and liked.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a comparison of it to another movie in your review.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your review aloud and discuss it with someone.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about movies.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a review about a movie.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I compare two movies in my review.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my review.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn8le07ob11re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn8le07ob11re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I think this was a great idea!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So do we!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: The old slick Hollywood musicals! I'm glad I could make it! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So are we! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: This is as exciting as it gets for a movie buff like me! The food is as good as I get from the priciest places in town!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think so too. I can't remember having better snacks than these!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: These are the most delicious sandwiches. Mine are never as tasty as yours.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Neither are mine!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Even though we're cooking as often as we can these days. Right Sal!"}, {"image": "engenn8le07ob11re2img01.jpg", "time": "30000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You'll be as good a cook as most people in no time.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm not so sure about that ...<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Neither am I. My food is edible, but that is as far as it goes for now, I think.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Me too. I'm never going to be a great cook!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm not either, Sal. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Show Peter the latest pictures of your purchases from our shopathon!"}, {"image": "engenn8le07ob11re2img02.jpg", "time": "49500", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Have a look. I am stepping up my game! I'm mixing vintage and new. Aren't they the coolest?! I got some neat marked down accessories!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: The businesswomen in Boston don't look as fashionable as this, Sal. It's so much trendier! Hey, how was the music festival?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Classical, rap ... it was a bit disappointing.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Ah, but tonight will make up for it!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh Peter!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le07ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le07ob11re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about socializing, fashion and clothing.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can compare two things or people and describe the quality of an object or a person.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can agree or disagree with <span class=\"italic\">so</span> or <span class=\"italic\">neither</span>.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How often do you get together with friends?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Where do you go?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What do you like to do?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "t